    <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Host.Event.LiveMigrationFailed.Alert.Rule"><Name>Hyper-V live migration failed</Name><Description>A virtual machine live migration or quick migration failed on this host (Hyper-V-VMMS events 21502, 21501, 21125 or 20413). The VM stays on its source host; Cluster-Aware Updating, drain and manual migrations that depend on it stall.</Description></DisplayString>
    <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Host.Event.LiveMigrationFailed.Alert.Rule.AlertMessage"><Name>Hyper-V live migration failed</Name><Description>Event {0} on the Hyper-V host: {1}</Description></DisplayString>
